Planetside 2 is a Free to Play PVP first person shooter in a sci-fi world.  It take skill, tactics and cooperation to new levels, as you help take control of forts and outposts on a huge world with 5 continents.  Has 6 player classes and modifications galore, but it does require you to grind through combat to improve your skills and unlocking weapons. There are 3 factions to join, each with their own benefits. You can also drive or fly combat vehicles, but all vehicles cost in-game resources, larger vehicles cost more in in-game resources.
You can play for free on Planetside 2, but the cash shop sells buffs for XP, Cert points, Resources, and cosmetics stuff.
